        "TileImage": "$($repository 0314f8d3-3b07-428f-ac47-67a7582b3a6d).Image",
        "Description": "Looks like there is trouble in Italy again, 47. Our client is a big stealth fan and asked for someone with ninja like skills. Couldn&apos;t think of anyone better than you. Like a true ninja, you&apos;re a ghost. Leaving no trace you were ever there. Bring your ninja suit and tools. Good luck Ninja 47.",
